OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA largely dry and bright day
OL,6,Ffor many with sunny spells. The odd
OL,7,Fshower possible, mainly towards the
OL,8,Fnorthwest. Temperatures nearer average.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,11,Freturns Friday, potentially heavy at
OL,12,Ftimes. The weekend turns drier and
OL,13,Fbrighter with sunny spells, though
OL,14,Fovernight fog patches are possible.
OL,15,FTemperatures remain near average for
OL,16,Fearly October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
